  "label": "User projected onto the woman as 'me' in the text",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman, who is depicted with an exaggerated expression of shock and disbelief. This projection is explicitly anchored by the textual material 'If he's marrying me then why's he fucking a goat,' where 'me' directly refers to the woman. The user identifies with the woman as the victim of betrayal, making her the embodied representation of 'me' in the meme's narrative. The woman's physical posture and facial expression visually represent the shock and outrage implied by the text, reinforcing the user's identification with her emotional state.",
